cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: eig3x3-lean
abstract: >-
  A pure Lean 4 library for closed-form eigenvalue and eigenvector
  decomposition of 3 x 3 real matrices. Eigenvalues follow the numerically
  stabilized closed-form evaluation of Habera and Zilian; eigenvectors use
  Eberly's null-space construction from known eigenvalues. Native Lean4 and 
  no external dependencies.
authors:
